# Curate the GitHub language bar for an on-chain course.
# The authored source of interest is Solidity (the smart contracts); the HTML
# is slide decks / demos (teaching material), the JSON files are compiled
# contract artifacts, and the Python/JS are interaction & tooling scripts
# around the contracts. Files are unchanged — this only affects the language %.
*.html linguist-documentation
*.json linguist-generated
*.py   linguist-detectable=false
*.js   linguist-detectable=false
